<title>GERMANY: SGL Carbon 9-mo pre-tax profit up 35 pct.</title>
<headline>SGL Carbon 9-mo pre-tax profit up 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     223     vs 166</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,285   vs 1,172</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   231     vs 186</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   140     vs 110</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    220     vs 176</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share (DVFA)	6.73    vs 5.27 marks</p>
<p>Full company name of German carbon and graphite group is SGL Carbon AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
